msgid ""
"A clip with an alpha channel (or an :doc:`alpha mask effect </"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying>`) is required. The clip "
"in the :guilabel:`Composition track` is essentially clipped by the alpha "
"channel."
